Description: |
  Salt's cache subsystem: a stable `Cache`/`MemCache` facade over a dynamically-dispatched
  backend driver loaded through `salt/loader`. The mutation notation models the driver
  (`LocalFSBackend`) as a same-shape concretization reached by dynamic dispatch, not inheritance.
